{"package":"Copy-SshId","version":"2.1.2","assessment":"complete","packageSha256":"6ee0fba561a616decfe6d7f0beab30d5f5b1daf9eef912e85e47f48204041572","scannedAt":"2026-10-24T09:15:19.664Z","scannerVersion":"0.1.0","rulesetVersion":"0.1.0","tools":{"powerShell":"7.5.12","psscriptAnalyzer":"1.25.0","psscriptAnalyzerExpected":"1.25.0","clamav":null},"packageUrl":"https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/Copy-SshId/2.1.2","metadata":{"title":"Copy-SshId","description":"向目标主机安装SSH公钥实现免密登录，或从目标主机移除本机公钥恢复密码登录。\r\n\r\n语法：\r\n  安装公钥：Copy-SshId [用户@]主机 [-RemoteUser 用户] [-RemotePort 端口] [-KeyFile 公钥路径]\r\n    别名：-RemoteUser=-l  -RemotePort=-p  -KeyFile=-i\r\n    例：Copy-SshId root@192.168.1.10\r\n        Copy-SshId 192.168.1.10 -l root -p 2222 -i C:\\Users\\xxx\\.ssh\\id_ed25519.pub\r\n    未指定 -KeyFile 时自动选用 ~\\.ssh 下第一个可用公钥；免密已生效时直接跳过。\r\n\r\n  移除公钥：Remove-SshId [用户@]主机 [-RemoteUser 用户] [-RemotePort 端口] [-KeyFile 公钥路径]\r\n    例：Remove-SshId root@192.168.1.10\r\n    仅在当前可免密登录时执行；未指定 -KeyFile 时移除 ~\\.ssh 下所有公钥对应条目。","authors":"埃博拉酱","owners":"Ebola-Chan","projectUrl":"https://github.com/Ebola-Chan-bot/Copy-SshId","publishedAt":"2026-10-16T03:10:26.383","updatedAt":"2026-10-23T07:00:26.79","tags":["SSH","公钥","免密登录","authorized_keys","OpenSSH","Windows","Linux","PSModule"]},"dependencies":[],"fileInventory":[{"path":"_rels/.rels","size":504,"crc32":"9eed186f","extension":"rels"},{"path":"Copy-SshId.nuspec","size":1651,"crc32":"1662600b","extension":"nuspec"},{"path":"Copy-SshId.psd1","size":3706,"crc32":"7c2825f3","extension":"psd1"},{"path":"Copy-SshId.psm1","size":49426,"crc32":"59b313c3","extension":"psm1"},{"path":"Install-SshKey.ps1","size":8893,"crc32":"7dd805d9","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"Install-SshKey.sh","size":1360,"crc32":"4b0c6e54","extension":"sh"},{"path":"Invoke-Bootstrap.ps1","size":821,"crc32":"6f9a0666","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"Read-SshPassword.ps1","size":345,"crc32":"fc0717fc","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"Set-DefaultShell.ps1","size":1307,"crc32":"a07f7f7d